# Identity Center group membership for platform permission sets.
#
# Copy to config/identity.env and fill in. That file is gitignored: it holds
# personal data (names and direct email addresses) and must not enter version
# control. The pre-commit hook blocks it.
#
# Group DISPLAY NAMES are not personal data and live in the repository — the
# defaults below are correct and should not normally be changed. Only the
# member lists belong here.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Member list format
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
#   GivenName|FamilyName|email[,GivenName|FamilyName|email...]
#
# Pipes within a record, commas between records. Neither character is legal in
# an email address, so the format cannot be ambiguous. Whitespace around any
# field is stripped.
#
#   COMMERCIAL_READONLY_MEMBERS="Ada|Lovelace|ada@example.com,Alan|Turing|alan@example.com"
#
# The email is used as the Identity Center user name, which is what the person
# signs in with at the access portal.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file has a shelf life
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# It exists because the Identity Center identity source is still the built-in
# directory, so users and groups have to be created somewhere. Once the source
# is switched to Entra, SCIM provisions both from Entra group membership and
# this file becomes the wrong place to change access. Delete it then; do not
# keep two sources of truth for who has access to what.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CommercialReadOnly — billing and cost data only (design doc 12)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AltDigital commercial function. Full portfolio, all partners, all clients.
# A partner-scoped variant for partner business users is prompt 14.5 and does
# not exist yet — do not put partner staff in this group.
COMMERCIAL_READONLY_GROUP="CommercialReadOnly"
COMMERCIAL_READONLY_MEMBERS=""
